msgstr "Animation lorsque l'infobulle disparaît."

#: add-to-home-screen-wp.php:409 add-to-home-screen-wp.php:661
msgid "Start Delay"
msgstr "Délai de démarrage"

#: add-to-home-screen-wp.php:413 add-to-home-screen-wp.php:665
msgid ""
"Note: Ensure this is not too close to Lifespan to give users enough time to "
"read the balloon."
msgstr ""
"Remarque : Assurez-vous que ce délai n'est pas trop proche de la durée de "
"vie pour donner aux utilisateurs suffisamment de temps pour lire l'infobulle."

#: add-to-home-screen-wp.php:417 add-to-home-screen-wp.php:669
msgid "Lifespan"
msgstr "Durée de vie"

#: add-to-home-screen-wp.php:421 add-to-home-screen-wp.php:673
msgid ""
"Note: Set this sufficiently higher than Start Delay to ensure the balloon "
"stays visible long enough."
msgstr ""
"Remarque : Définissez une valeur suffisamment supérieure au délai de "
"démarrage pour garantir que l'infobulle reste visible assez longtemps."

#: add-to-home-screen-wp.php:425 add-to-home-screen-wp.php:677
msgid "Expiration Time"
msgstr "Temps d'expiration"

#: add-to-home-screen-wp.php:432 add-to-home-screen-wp.php:684
